     <P align=center><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201811/2018112014204269.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201811/2018112014204261.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201811/2018112014204239.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201811/2018112014204278.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201811/2018112014204260.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201811/2018112014204248.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201811/2018112014204275.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201811/2018112014204295.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201811/2018112014211760.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201811/2018112014211752.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201811/2018112014211730.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201811/2018112014211769.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201811/2018112014211751.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201811/2018112014211739.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201811/2018112014211766.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; TEXT-INDENT: 24.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">回顾绍兴一中百年历程，犹如涓涓小流汇成，最终将奔赴浩瀚大海。其中，在沈金相校长任职期间，流亡办学的佳话在历史长河里冲刷得熠熠生辉，沉淀在每个一中学子的心海。金秋来临，为体味流亡办学时学生们步履维艰却坚持求学的精神与品质，我校于</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>11</FONT></SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">月</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>14</FONT></SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">日下午组织全体高一学生远足活动——步行六公里前往目的地湿地公园。</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt" lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; TEXT-INDENT: 0cm; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0" class=MsoListParagraph align=center><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">远足前，鼓动人心</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; TEXT-INDENT: 24.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">临行之前，所有同学在国旗台下集中，聆听学校领导的讲话。老师不仅明确重申了活动中的安全和文明问题，而且对同学们提出了“文明健康，不畏艰难，坚持不懈”的要求。六公里的长途也是一场硬战，它不同于考场中没有硝烟的较量与筛选，而是对师生们身体素质与心理承受的锤炼。与其说它是远足，倒不如说是一段试金石，将打磨掉同学们稚气的棱角。讲话最后，气氛不断推向高潮，同学们整装待发。</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; TEXT-INDENT: 0cm; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0" class=MsoListParagraph align=center><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">远足中，朝气蓬勃</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; TEXT-INDENT: 24.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">没有战火纷飞，也没有从一个地方匆忙辗转到别处的慌乱忐忑，朝气蓬勃的同学们身着整齐统一的蓝灰色校服，以班级为单位，沿人行道前进，彩旗飘飘。长长的队伍秩序井然，踩在落叶上沙沙作响，金黄的道路一直沿向前方。六公里的路很长，却没有人掉队，同学们互相扶持，相互打气，彼此坚持。六公里的路在一片欢笑声中变得很短，很轻松。</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; TEXT-INDENT: 0cm; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0" class=MsoListParagraph align=center><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">目的地，青春肆意</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; TEXT-INDENT: 24.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">一个小时的路程，已使师生们精疲力尽，大家远远望见景点的塔尖就兴奋不已。风撩过水面，泛起涟漪，也在师生的心头吹来袭袭清凉。坐在洋溢着秋天气息的草坪上，每个班的同学都玩得兴致盎然，情浓至深，欢笑连连。学到极致，玩得尽兴，是每个一中学子的日常。青春在每张年轻面孔上肆意，渲染了一段段芳华。</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">踏归途，繁华依旧</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; TEXT-INDENT: 24.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">在一起的时光总是不让人察觉地偷偷溜走。回去的途中，一样的六公里路，一样的整齐划一，一样的相互帮扶，一样的欢声笑语······从景点到学校，从放松到学习，从不完美到接近完美，经过远足，同学们心中有坚持初心，有珍惜现在、把握未来的种子簌簌抽长。</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; TEXT-INDENT: 24.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">日薄西山，两个半小时的远足是紧张的学习节奏中的小小的放松，却起到了锤炼心志的作用。我们没有流亡求学的经历，但是前辈们走过的路我们同学要走，做过的事我们要做，得到的未来我们也要争取。</SPAN></B></P>
